:{"changes":{"file:///tmp/go-test-script040847720/script-format_on_save_new_file/main.go":[{"range":{"start":{"line":0,"character":0},"end":{"line":1,"character":0}},"newText":""}]}}}] ``` ### What did you expect to see? The file contents preserved by the codeAction. ### What did you see instead? The package clause being removed 1 time in 5 this test runs. --- cc @stamblerre

