ndled by VSCode v1.68.1), so I suppose it may be caused by vscode itself rather than the tsserver. --- (updated 2022.9.4) Add two similar cases: ```ts const B = { Foo: class { } } namespace C { export class Foo { } } class BFoo extends B.Foo { // ^ error here, expect no error } class CFoo extends C.Foo { // ^ no error as expected } ```

